Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 13 08:14:47 2025 +1000

    Make fluentd optional.
    
    The refactoring of fluentd out of the common role into its own
    role appears to have missed supporting enable_fluentd being set
    to "no".
    
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

diff --git a/ansible/site.yml b/ansible/site.yml
index b3e06de..40e956a 100644
--- a/ansible/site.yml
+++ b/ansible/site.yml
@@ -110,10 +110,11 @@
     {{ fluentd_max_fail_percentage |
        default(kolla_max_fail_percentage) |
        default(100) }}
-  tags:
-    - fluentd
-  roles:
-    - role: fluentd
+  tasks:
+    - include_role:
+        name: fluentd
+      tags: fluentd
+      when: enable_fluentd | bool
 
 - name: Apply role loadbalancer
   gather_facts: false
